        "description": "Find rides that end near a target destination.\n\n**Mock Scenario**: Passenger wants to reach Mumbai city center (19.0760°N, 72.8777°E). Search within 2 km.\n\n**Expected Behavior**: Should find RIDE001 and RIDE003 whose dropoff points are near Mumbai."
      }
    },
